    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Overgrown, join up with a friend to explore a vibrant world overtaken by nature. A robot and a raccoon embark on a short adventure that they can only make it through together. Solve puzzles and navigate a post-human world to reveal a wordless story of disregard and abandonment. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Co-op</strong> - Two-player, local cooperative gameplay </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzles</strong> - Use each character's unique abilities to solve puzzles </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration</strong> - Discover lush environments while you travel into an abandoned city </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meaningful Play</strong> - Consider the impact of play in a subtle cautionary tale about climate change</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Overgrown, join up with a friend to explore a vibrant world overtaken by nature. A robot and a raccoon embark on a short adventure that they can only make it through together. Solve puzzles and navigate a post-human world to reveal a wordless story of disregard and abandonment. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Co-op</strong> - Two-player, local cooperative gameplay </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzles</strong> - Use each character's unique abilities to solve puzzles </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration</strong> - Discover lush environments while you travel into an abandoned city </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meaningful Play</strong> - Consider the impact of play in a subtle cautionary tale about climate change</p>",
    "short_description": "Grab a friend in this 2-player cooperative exploration and puzzle game where a robot and a raccoon explore a city overtaken by nature, revealing a wordless story of disregard and abandonment.",
